<title>PHILIPPINES: Phil Savings Bank sets 38.3 pct stock div.</title>
<headline>Phil Savings Bank sets 38.3 pct stock div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine Savings Bank on Wednesday announced a stock dividend of 38.3 percent.</p>
<p>The record date is not yet fixed, the bank said in a disclosure to the Philippine Stock Exchange.  </p>
<p>The stock dividend will be applied as full payment of subscription to an increase in authorised capital stock to five billion pesos from three billion, it said.</p>
<p>The bank said it had set the annual stockholders meeting for April 10. Stockholders on record as of March 4 will be entitled to notice and to vote at the meeting, it added.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8934</p>
